---
// Standalone Astro page — full HTML below mirrors the approved preview.
// Nav is inline; can be extracted to Base.astro in a follow-up refactor.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Become a host · Denver Social</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Outfit:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=Caveat:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#FFFFFF;--surface:#F8F9FB;--border:#E5E7EB;--text:#111827;--text-sec:#6B7280;--accent:#7C3AED;--accent2:#3B82F6;--mint:#10B981;--card-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);--space-2:8px;--space-3:12px;--space-4:16px;--space-5:24px;--space-6:32px;--space-7:48px;--space-8:64px;--space-9:96px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3,h4{line-height:1.2}
.site-nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(229,231,235,.6)}
.nav-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.brand{font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#7C3AED}
.brand span{color:#9CA3AF;font-weight:400}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:28px}
.nav-links a{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#374151;transition:color .15s}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.cur{color:#7C3AED}
.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.nav-right .nstatus{display:none;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;font-weight:500;align-items:center;gap:6px}
@media(min-width:920px){.nav-right .nstatus{display:inline-flex}}
.nav-right .nstatus .ndot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#10B981;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,.6);animation:dotPulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes dotPulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,.6)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(16,185,129,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,0)}}
.signin{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#374151}
.signin:hover{color:#7C3AED}
.join{background:#7C3AED;color:#fff;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;transition:background .15s}
.join:hover{background:#6D28D9}
@media(max-width:760px){.nav-links{display:none}.signin{display:none}}
.hero{padding:64px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFFBEB,#FEF3C7 50%,#FDE68A);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-100px;left:-100px;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,58,237,.2),transparent 70%);filter:blur(60px)}
.hero-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:var(--space-7);align-items:center;position:relative}
.hero-pill{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;background:#111;color:#FFD93D;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:50px;margin-bottom:var(--space-5)}
.hero h1{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);font-weight:900;margin-bottom:var(--space-4);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;font-family:'Caveat';font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);font-size:.55em;display:block;transform:rotate(-2deg);margin-top:6px}
.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#3F2D04;margin-bottom:var(--space-5);max-width:520px}
.hero-acts{display:flex;gap:var(--space-3);flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn-big{background:#111;color:#FFD93D;padding:18px 36px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.btn-big:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-big-out{background:#fff;color:#111;padding:18px 36px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;border:1.5px solid #111}
.host-card{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:var(--space-6);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.12);transform:rotate(2deg);border:1px solid var(--border);position:relative}
.stamp{position:absolute;top:-14px;right:-14px;width:80px;height:80px;background:#FF6B9D;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Outfit';font-weight:900;font-size:13px;text-align:center;line-height:1;transform:rotate(12deg);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(255,107,157,.4)}
.hc-meta{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:var(--space-2)}
.hc-title{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:32px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:var(--space-2);line-height:1.1}
.hc-host{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:var(--space-5)}
.hc-av{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#FCE7F3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px}
.hc-host-name{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-sec)}.hc-host-name strong{color:var(--text);display:block;font-size:14px}
.hc-details{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2);font-size:14px;padding:var(--space-4);background:var(--surface);border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:var(--space-5)}
.hc-details div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.hc-details span:first-child{color:var(--text-sec)}.hc-details span:last-child{font-weight:700}
.hc-rsvp{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-top:var(--space-4);border-top:1px dashed var(--border)}
.hc-rsvp-avs{display:flex}
.hc-rsvp-avs span{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #fff;font-size:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-left:-8px}
.hc-rsvp-avs span:nth-child(1){background:#FEF3C7;margin-left:0}
.hc-rsvp-avs span:nth-child(2){background:#DBEAFE}.hc-rsvp-avs span:nth-child(3){background:#D1FAE5}.hc-rsvp-avs span:nth-child(4){background:#FCE7F3}
.hc-count{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-sec)}
@media (max-width:980px){.hero-in{grid-template-columns:1fr}.host-card{transform:none;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto}}
.benefits,.feature{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:#fff}.benefits-in,.feature-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.section-eyebrow{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
.section-h2{font-family:'Outfit';text-align:center;font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-4)}
.section-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--text-sec);font-size:18px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto var(--space-8)}
.ben-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:var(--space-5)}
.ben{padding:var(--space-6) var(--space-5);background:var(--surface);border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.ben-icon{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:var(--space-4);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.ben h3{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:17px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}.ben p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-sec);line-height:1.5}
@media (max-width:980px){.ben-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media (max-width:580px){.ben-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.feature{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--surface),#fff)}
.host-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:var(--space-5);margin-top:var(--space-7)}
.h-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.h-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.h-banner{height:120px;position:relative}
.b1{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FCE7F3,#FBCFE8)}.b2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#DBEAFE,#93C5FD)}.b3{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#D1FAE5,#6EE7B7)}
.h-av{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:4px solid #fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;position:absolute;bottom:-28px;left:24px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.h-body{padding:var(--space-7) var(--space-5) var(--space-5)}
.h-name{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:2px}
.h-tag{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:var(--space-4)}
.h-quote{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-sec);line-height:1.5;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:var(--space-4);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding-left:12px}
.h-stats{display:flex;gap:var(--space-4);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-sec)}
.h-stats strong{display:block;font-family:'Outfit';font-size:18px;color:var(--text);font-weight:900}
@media (max-width:880px){.host-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.how{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:#0F0F23;color:#fff}.how-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.how h2{font-family:'Outfit';text-align:center;font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-4);color:#fff}
.how .sub{text-align:center;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:var(--space-8)}
.how-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:var(--space-5)}
.how-step{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:var(--space-6) var(--space-5)}
.how-num{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:42px;font-weight:900;color:#FFD93D;line-height:1;margin-bottom:var(--space-4)}
.how-step h3{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px;color:#fff}
.how-step p{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.5}
@media (max-width:980px){.how-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media (max-width:580px){.how-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.faq{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:#fff}.faq-in{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
.faq h2{font-family:'Outfit';text-align:center;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-6)}
details{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer}
details:hover{border-color:#D1D5DB}
details[open]{background:#fff;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(124,58,237,.08)}
summary{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;list-style:none}
summary::after{content:"+";font-family:'Outfit';font-size:24px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:300}
details[open] summary::after{content:"−"}
details p{margin-top:12px;font-size:15px;color:var(--text-sec);line-height:1.6}
.cta-final{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));color:#fff;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cta-final::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(255,217,61,.3),transparent 50%)}
.cta-final h2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);font-weight:900;margin-bottom:var(--space-3);position:relative}
.cta-final p{font-size:18px;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto var(--space-6);opacity:.9;position:relative}
.btn-yellow{background:#FFD93D;color:#111;padding:18px 36px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;display:inline-block;position:relative}
</style></head><body>

<header class="site-nav"><div class="nav-in">
  <a href="/" class="brand">denver<span>social</span>hub</a>
  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="/events">Events</a>
    <a href="/potlucks">Potlucks</a>
    <a href="/community">Community</a>
    <a href="/about">About</a>
    <a href="/host" class="cur">Host</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="nav-right">
    <span class="nstatus"><span class="ndot"></span>Denver, CO</span>
    <a href="/sign-in" class="signin">Sign in</a>
    <a href="/signup" class="join">Join us</a>
  </div>
</div></header>

<section class="hero"><div class="hero-in">
  <div>
    <span class="hero-pill">— FREE FOREVER · LIVE IN 2 MINUTES</span>
    <h1>Host the kind of night you'd actually go to. <em>~ we'll fill the room. ~</em></h1>
    <p>Book club, pottery class, neighborhood walk, salsa night, breakfast burrito crawl — whatever it is, you bring the idea, we bring the people. Seth started with a table for 8 in RiNo; you can start smaller.</p>
    <div class="hero-acts"><a href="/events/new" class="btn-big">Start hosting →</a><a href="#examples" class="btn-big-out">See examples</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="host-card">
    <div class="stamp">6 GOING 🔥</div>
    <div class="hc-meta">SAT MAY 30 · 12:00 PM</div>
    <h3 class="hc-title">Summer Kickoff Potluck</h3>
    <div class="hc-host"><div class="hc-av">🍽</div><div class="hc-host-name">hosted by <strong>Seth · Cap Hill</strong></div></div>
    <div class="hc-details">
      <div><span>📍 Where</span><span>Cheesman Park · pavilion</span></div>
      <div><span>👥 Group</span><span>12–24 people</span></div>
      <div><span>💸 Cost</span><span>Free · bring a dish</span></div>
      <div><span>🍷 Vibe</span><span>Picnic, sunset, kids OK</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hc-rsvp"><div class="hc-rsvp-avs"><span>🥗</span><span>🍕</span><span>🍰</span><span>🥤</span></div><div class="hc-count">+10 others going</div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="benefits"><div class="benefits-in">
  <span class="section-eyebrow">— WHY HOST WITH US</span>
  <h2 class="section-h2">We do the heavy lifting.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">You bring the idea and the energy. The platform handles the rest.</p>
  <div class="ben-grid">
    <div class="ben"><div class="ben-icon">📢</div><h3>Reach the right crowd</h3><p>Listed in front of locals already looking for what you're doing. No marketing to figure out.</p></div>
    <div class="ben"><div class="ben-icon">📅</div><h3>RSVPs handled</h3><p>Caps, waitlists, reminders, cancellations, ICS files — all built in.</p></div>
    <div class="ben"><div class="ben-icon">🪪</div><h3>Your own page</h3><p>denversocialhub.com/u/yourname — yours forever, edit anytime, no account fees.</p></div>
    <div class="ben"><div class="ben-icon">🛟</div><h3>Safety baked in</h3><p>Reporting tools, member verification, and a human on call if anything goes sideways.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="feature" id="examples"><div class="feature-in">
  <span class="section-eyebrow">— MEET A FEW HOSTS</span>
  <h2 class="section-h2">Hosts run the platform.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">No moderators, no community managers. Just locals who decided to make a thing.</p>
  <div class="host-row">
    <div class="h-card">
      <div class="h-banner b1"><div class="h-av">🍳</div></div>
      <div class="h-body">
        <div class="h-name">Sam Castellanos</div><div class="h-tag">@sam · Capitol Hill</div>
        <div class="h-quote">"Started as me cooking too much pasta for myself. Now it's a thing. The platform handled all the awkward parts."</div>
        <div class="h-stats"><div><strong>14</strong>events hosted</div><div><strong>108</strong>guests</div><div><strong>4.9</strong>rating</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="h-card">
      <div class="h-banner b2"><div class="h-av">🥾</div></div>
      <div class="h-body">
        <div class="h-name">Devon Kim</div><div class="h-tag">@devon · Highlands</div>
        <div class="h-quote">"I just wanted hiking buddies. Posted a 'sunrise hike?' note and twelve people showed up. We do it every Friday now."</div>
        <div class="h-stats"><div><strong>26</strong>events hosted</div><div><strong>184</strong>guests</div><div><strong>5.0</strong>rating</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="h-card">
      <div class="h-banner b3"><div class="h-av">🏺</div></div>
      <div class="h-body">
        <div class="h-name">Jin Okafor</div><div class="h-tag">@jin · RiNo</div>
        <div class="h-quote">"My studio sits empty on Saturdays anyway. Now it's full of people who'd never have tried pottery otherwise."</div>
        <div class="h-stats"><div><strong>8</strong>events hosted</div><div><strong>64</strong>guests</div><div><strong>4.8</strong>rating</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="how"><div class="how-in">
  <h2>From idea to live event</h2><p class="sub">Roughly the time it takes to make coffee.</p>
  <div class="how-row">
    <div class="how-step"><div class="how-num">01</div><h3>Sketch it out</h3><p>Title, neighborhood, date, vibe. One paragraph is plenty.</p></div>
    <div class="how-step"><div class="how-num">02</div><h3>Set the size</h3><p>Cap RSVPs, open a waitlist, or leave it uncapped.</p></div>
    <div class="how-step"><div class="how-num">03</div><h3>Hit publish</h3><p>It goes live on the calendar. People start RSVPing within hours.</p></div>
    <div class="how-step"><div class="how-num">04</div><h3>Show up</h3><p>We send everyone reminders. You just have to be there.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="faq"><div class="faq-in">
  <h2>Common questions</h2>
  <details open><summary>Is it really free?</summary><p>Yep. Hosting is free, listing is free, RSVPing is free. No premium tier, no transaction cut on anything you decide to charge for entry.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What if nobody shows up?</summary><p>It happens — usually because the date or vibe wasn't quite right. Seth's first event had four people. Now they're forty. Pick a weekend and try.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How do I deal with no-shows?</summary><p>Members earn reputation over time — repeat no-shows lose RSVP privileges. You can also overbook a bit.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I charge for tickets?</summary><p>Yes. Stripe is built in. You keep 100% minus Stripe's standard fees.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What about safety?</summary><p>Every account is email-verified. Every event has a host, locations are public, and we remove anyone who makes others uncomfortable. Reporting is one tap on every event page.</p></details>
</div></section>

<section class="cta-final">
  <h2>Your first event is one form away.</h2>
  <p>No app to download, no contract, no commitment past the one Saturday.</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn-yellow">Start hosting — it's free →</a>
</section>

</body></html>
